    "turn_idx": 8,
    "turn_text": "By the way, on Miffer-Pristone itself, I mean, my take on this Congresswoman is that there was a political decision by the rogue partisan majority that didn't want to hurt the candidacy of their candidate, Donald Trump, by ruling against Miffer-Pristone, and they'll wait for the proper plaintiffs post November, and probably do what they did in Dobbs. Do you have a more optimistic view?",
