  },
  {
    "episode_id": 91703,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/1/91703.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 9,
    "turn_text": "Well, as I said, you know, today while we did, you know, avert a catastrophic ban on the pre-stone and abortion care. We know that Republicans are not going to stop. If nothing else, Jim, they don't make threats. They make promises. They always telegraph their punch. They always telegraph their heart. And that's why we have to remain vigilant. You know, their attacks are coordinated and they are persistent when it comes to reproductive freedom. And that's exactly why we have to do everything. I am doing everything with my power to ensure that we get that gavel back. The Democrats get that gavel back because Congress has to legislate to protect and expand access to abortion care. And that means passing my legislation, the Abortion Justice Act, but it's also about the Women's Health Protection Act. So we have to continue to fight to affirm abortion care and health care. and the fundamental human rights that it is.",
