    "turn_idx": 10,
    "turn_text": "You know, I wonder, Councilman, we've seen a lot of voting in red states that put tighter, much tighter restrictions on, in some cases, all but banned abortion. And obviously, even in Kansas, like Kansas, a fairly conservative state, people want reproductive rights. Don't you think the voters are going to dissuade some of these most extreme Republicans or is that wishful thinking on my part? Well,",
