    "turn_idx": 56,
    "turn_text": "Well, you know one of the wonderful things, because my mother was a piano teacher and I played piano for like ten years, I think it makes a huge difference in your brain. Learning music, memorizing music, being able to read, sheet music, understand the beats and stuff, this is something that every kid should have to the max and most kids don't, never mind, not just in Boston, but in most public schools all across the country.",
